BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-11-28T04:30:00&endDate=2026-11-30T01:29:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nELIZABETH LINE: Saturday 28 and Sunday 29 November\, no service between Maidenhead / Heathrow (all terminals) and Abbey Wood / Shenfield. Use PICCADILLY LINE services between Heathrow and Central London. LONDON PADDINGTON STATION will be closed on this day\, with no HEATHROW EXPRESS services. GWR services will not run between Maidenhead / Greenford and Paddington\, with limited long distance services to/from Euston. There will also be no GREATER ANGLIA services on these days between Shenfield / Southend Victoria / Southminster and Liverpool Street\, use CENTRAL LINE connections between Ealing Broadway\, West Acton (for Acton Main Line)\, Central London\, Liverpool Street\, Stratford and Newbury Park. Replacement bus services operate\, not serving Iver\, please use Langley instead.
DTEND:20261130T012900Z
DTSTART:20261128T043000Z
SUMMARY:Elizabeth line: Part Closure
UID:ab8b2975-1301-436a-8734-bbfc62ba23cf@ab8b.org
